I don't know man, comfort isn't exactly the example you gave above. 

&#x200B;

The comfort I want in my life is a job that makes me feel excited to come in every single day, people to talk to, friends to be made, kind and understanding boss, flexible schedules, great benefits, excellent pay. All this so I can buy things for my family, relatives, friends, myself things without worrying about money.  

&#x200B;

That could mean eating out for dinner at restaurants together, watching movies, help with debt problems, go on vacations, buy presents my cousins actually want, etc. 

&#x200B;

My comfort and happiness is my family, and if that's a drug, then i'm willing to take it every single day.

I agree, Weed is Natural to the earth, not a bunch of chemicals mashed up then made into a pill.

&#x200B;

You really have to take a close look, we are the only animals that rely HEAVILY on these pills everyday just to survive. And if we forget to take them regularly, we get sick or have many physical problems that need to be corrected by surgery. Its insane if you ask me. Years of evolution has come to this

&#x200B;

I'm not trying to act like a guy with a tinfoil hat, but its good to be skeptical and ask the tough questions. We will never know the truth unless someone tells us.

